          "docs": "<p>Rejects a pending certificate transfer. After IoT rejects a certificate transfer, the certificate status changes from <b>PENDING_TRANSFER</b> to <b>INACTIVE</b>.</p> <p>To check for pending certificate transfers, call <a>ListCertificates</a> to enumerate your certificates.</p> <p>This operation can only be called by the transfer destination. After it is called, the certificate will be returned to the source's account in the INACTIVE state.</p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"htt"
